scenario A_single_threaded 1
group default exclusive
timer control 10 2 default
sub scan 20 3 default
timer logger 100 35 default
trace 95 145
run 1000
scenario B_two_threads_one_group 2
group default exclusive
timer control 10 2 default
sub scan 20 3 default
timer logger 100 35 default
run 1000
scenario C_two_threads_two_groups 2
group ctrl exclusive
group other exclusive
timer control 10 2 ctrl
sub scan 20 3 other
timer logger 100 35 other
trace 95 145
run 1000
scenario D_two_threads_reentrant 2
group all reentrant
timer control 10 2 all
sub scan 20 3 all
timer logger 100 35 all
run 1000
